dance Skip
// The highs push the morph; the hi-hats bring it nearer; the bass sets how fast it spins and the
// highs turn it; drops in the bass reverse it.
// Inspired by trippety, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.high speed 0.88 settle 0.01
zoom follows music.high_hit amount 0.5 settle 94.3
spin follows music.bass from 45.8 to 286 smooth 0
turn on music.high changes by 0.46
reverse on music.bass drops by 0.43 on 64 off 16
